    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b34f9a9d1c9474a50bbcc812",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星才是最亮的星星。\n在万物的头上闪耀。\n我总有一天要成为众人仰望的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2ec551bd4c2ebe025adc5d6a68f5b074f095765e46c4d95ea6aaeefe489b9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0091/storytimeline_830091003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac0d7684913166962a38e31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那颗星星就像狼牙的光芒。\n──锐利、凶猛、贪婪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6869490a9a755efa7a31fd639fa453f45c817c4b82fdaf21b6cfc7710f4bd987",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0091/storytimeline_830091003.json",
      "json_path": [
