      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征露出愉快的笑容，\n离开了这里。\n总之，能平安落幕真是太好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d4d529e9a574e46152d4d017e8c432d47bfcc3701cb6c0d622bf54d0ef1a13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
